flowchart TD
    %% GithubGovernor: who may read and write a governed domain
    q[Question about a domain] --> app{GitHub App configured?}
    app -->|no| plain[Ordinary membership rules]
    app -->|yes| origin{Domain has an origin?}
    origin -->|no| plain
    origin -->|yes| snap{Snapshot for the repository?}
    snap -->|none| noaccess[No access: fail closed]
    snap -->|fresh, under 5 min| level[Snapshot::level_of by GitHub id]
    snap -->|expired| ask[Ask GitHub again]
    ask -->|answer| level
    ask -->|failure, within 1 h| stale[Serve the stale snapshot]
    ask -->|failure, past 1 h| noaccess
    stale --> level
    level --> answer([MemberLevel])
